{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","title":"prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":3453,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-metric-has-signature]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-normal-space]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","line":5975,"source":"\\begin{proposition}[A Single Normal Vector Decides the Signature at a Point]\n\\label{prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-metric-has-signature, def:pseudo-normal-space, def:induced-tensor-along-map, lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre, prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane, lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal, lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane, lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\n\n\n\nLet $(\\widetilde M,\\widetilde g)$ have signature $(r,s)$ and let $F$ present a codimension-one pseudo-Riemannian submanifold with induced metric $g$. If $(r_x,s_x)$ is the signature at $x$ and $0\\ne v\\in N_xM$, then positive $v$ gives $r_x+1=r$, $s_x=s$, while negative $v$ gives $r_x=r$, $s_x+1=s$.\n\\end{proposition}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-metric-has-signature,lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre,prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane,lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal,lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane,lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\\sketch In $V=T_{F(x)}\\widetilde M$, put $W=dF_x(T_xM)$. Definition \\ref{def:pseudo-metric-has-signature}, Lemmas \\ref{lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}, \\ref{lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane}, and \\ref{lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal} meet the hypotheses of Proposition \\ref{prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane}; transfer its result to $g_x$ by Lemma \\ref{lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre}.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[A Single Normal Vector Decides the Signature at a Point] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a6879706572737572666163652d7369676e61747572652d61742d612d706f696e74\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-metric-has-signature\">↗ def:pseudo-metric-has-signature</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-normal-space\">↗ def:pseudo-normal-space</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-tensor-along-map\">↗ def:induced-tensor-along-map</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Asubmanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre\">↗ lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane\">↗ prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal\">↗ lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahypersurface-tangent-hyperplane\">↗ lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-submanifold-immersion\">↗ lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion</a> <p></p>Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(\\widetilde M,\\widetilde g)$\">$(\\widetilde M,\\widetilde g)$</span> have signature <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(r,s)$\">$(r,s)$</span> and let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F$\">$F$</span> present a codimension-one pseudo-Riemannian submanifold with induced metric <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g$\">$g$</span>. If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(r_x,s_x)$\">$(r_x,s_x)$</span> is the signature at <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x$\">$x$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$0\\ne v\\in N_xM$\">$0\\ne v\\in N_xM$</span>, then positive <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v$\">$v$</span> gives <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$r_x+1=r$\">$r_x+1=r$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$s_x=s$\">$s_x=s$</span>, while negative <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v$\">$v$</span> gives <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$r_x=r$\">$r_x=r$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$s_x+1=s$\">$s_x+1=s$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-metric-has-signature\">↗ def:pseudo-metric-has-signature</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Asubmanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre\">↗ lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane\">↗ prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal\">↗ lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahypersurface-tangent-hyperplane\">↗ lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-submanifold-immersion\">↗ lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion</a> \\sketch In <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$V=T_{F(x)}\\widetilde M$\">$V=T_{F(x)}\\widetilde M$</span>, put <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$W=dF_x(T_xM)$\">$W=dF_x(T_xM)$</span>. Definition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-metric-has-signature\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-metric-has-signature\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6465663a70736575646f2d6d65747269632d6861732d7369676e6174757265\">3</a>, Lemmas <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-submanifold-immersion\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70736575646f2d7375626d616e69666f6c642d696d6d657273696f6e\">17</a>, <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahypersurface-tangent-hyperplane\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6879706572737572666163652d74616e67656e742d6879706572706c616e65\">17</a>, and <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70736575646f2d6e6f726d616c2d73706163652d65712d6f7274686f676f6e616c\">17</a> meet the hypotheses of Proposition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a6879706572737572666163652d7369676e61747572652d706f696e74776973652d6879706572706c616e65\">17</a>; transfer its result to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g_x$\">$g_x$</span> by Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Asubmanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a7375626d616e69666f6c642d7369676e61747572652d696e2d616d6269656e742d6669627265\">17</a>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-nondegenerate","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-metric-has-signature","title":"def:pseudo-metric-has-signature","label":"def:pseudo-metric-has-signature"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-normal-space","title":"def:pseudo-normal-space","label":"def:pseudo-normal-space"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map","title":"def:induced-tensor-along-map","label":"def:induced-tensor-along-map"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre","title":"lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre","label":"lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane","title":"prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane","label":"prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal","title":"lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal","label":"lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane","title":"lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane","label":"lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","title":"lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","label":"lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature","title":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature","label":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","title":"prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","tex":"\\begin{proposition}[A Single Normal Vector Decides the Signature at a Point]\n\\label{prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-metric-has-signature, def:pseudo-normal-space, def:induced-tensor-along-map, lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre, prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane, lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal, lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane, lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\n\n\n\nLet $(\\widetilde M,\\widetilde g)$ have signature $(r,s)$ and let $F$ present a codimension-one pseudo-Riemannian submanifold with induced metric $g$. If $(r_x,s_x)$ is the signature at $x$ and $0\\ne v\\in N_xM$, then positive $v$ gives $r_x+1=r$, $s_x=s$, while negative $v$ gives $r_x=r$, $s_x+1=s$.\n\\end{proposition}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-metric-has-signature,lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre,prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane,lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal,lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane,lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\\sketch In $V=T_{F(x)}\\widetilde M$, put $W=dF_x(T_xM)$. Definition \\ref{def:pseudo-metric-has-signature}, Lemmas \\ref{lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}, \\ref{lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane}, and \\ref{lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal} meet the hypotheses of Proposition \\ref{prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane}; transfer its result to $g_x$ by Lemma \\ref{lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre}.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-metric-has-signature","title":"def:pseudo-metric-has-signature","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-normal-space","title":"def:pseudo-normal-space","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map","title":"def:induced-tensor-along-map","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre","title":"lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane","title":"prop:hypersurface-signature-pointwise-hyperplane","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal","title":"lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane","title":"lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","title":"lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}